      "subject": "fix(mcp): validate doctor probe against its discovered output contract (#1461)",
      "body": "fix(mcp): validate doctor probe against its discovered output contract (#1461)\n\nValidate the target-free probe against the named definition discovered from the complete production catalog. Preserve initialized server and inventory observations when the SDK rejects the probe, and retain the schema failure reason, absolute deadline and owned-child cleanup.\n\nThe negative stdio replay regression fails on original main and passes the fix; actual production-boundary fault injection confirms rejection. Nine doctor/help tests, serial full static checks and real small-target CLI/MCP parity pass. Successful doctor reports remain byte-identical. No performance or model-token reduction is claimed.\n\nCloses #1454. Refs #1065, #723, #1433.",
