      "body": "perf(apple): state each NIB object's class, label, and ID once (#1477)\n\nThe NIBArchive projection synthesizes customClass, label, and objectID so\nits records share the ibtool dictionary parser. The parser then returned\nthose values as class_name, name, and the object ID, and the graph node\nkept the synthesized copies in attributes as well. Attributes now omit a\nkey whose value its canonical field already carries; differing authored\nvalues stay. Transmission.app decode_interface_builder output shrinks\nfrom 6.45 MB to 6.14 MB.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
