      "sha": "a0e5e9db2b9e3645295e1c060c01d1f24aa7e277",
      "subject": "perf(artifacts)!: name each edge's child through its occurrence (#1493)",
      "body": "perf(artifacts)!: name each edge's child through its occurrence (#1493)\n\nEvery inventory edge is created from one occurrence and copied that\noccurrence's artifact_id and logical_path as child_artifact_id and\nlogical_path. Edges now keep the occurrence_id reference alone. Edge IDs\nstill hash the same child and path, read from the occurrence, so they are\nunchanged; validation and artifact comparison read the occurrence too.\n\ninspect_artifact output: Transmission.app 1.10 MB to 0.97 MB, Visual\nStudio Code.app 15.37 MB to 13.48 MB.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Artifact inventory edges no longer include\nchild_artifact_id or logical_path; read them from the occurrence named by\noccurrence_id. The graph commitment changes, so inventory Evidence\nrecorded by earlier versions no longer validates.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
