      "sha": "911323c5dd27f4bc924b74c803587164f79f4984",
      "subject": "fix(native): page every retained function dossier collection (#1507)",
      "body": "fix(native): page every retained function dossier collection (#1507)\n\ninspect_analysis_view is the recovery path when an analyze_function\ndossier exceeds the MCP response budget, but its native facets covered\nonly procedure, pseudocode, assembly, callers/callees, references, and\nvalue flow. Basic blocks, comments, unresolved calls, referenced strings\nand names, and the native API record could not be read from retained\nEvidence at all; basic blocks grow with the function just like assembly.\n\nThese are now facets: collections page by rows, and native_api is a\nsingleton. A dossier without an unresolved_calls record reports \"not\nrecorded\" rather than the value-flow failure reason.\n\nRefs #1247 and #1065.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
