      "body": "fix(setup): honor active client configuration and skill roots (#1504)\n\n* refactor(setup): resolve skill destinations per client\n\n* fix(setup): honor active client configuration and skill roots\n\n* fix(setup): validate effective client scopes and Gemini trust\n\n* fix(setup): treat empty OpenCode overrides as unset\n\nAn empty OPENCODE_CONFIG_DIR now stays on the XDG directory, and doctor\nand setup inspect global OpenCode files when a custom directory is absent.\nUninstall reports one status per client so a missing earlier layer does\nnot hide a removed registration.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>",
