      "sha": "afdaf981171213b8f7e739ded685e8e805a8e842",
      "subject": "fix(hopper): treat a directory launcher path as missing (#1426)",
      "body": "fix(hopper): treat a directory launcher path as missing (#1426)\n\n`HOPPER_LAUNCHER_PATH` availability was decided by an `X_OK` access check\nalone, which a searchable directory also passes. Pointing it at the\n`Hopper Disassembler.app` bundle instead of its launcher made `rea providers`\nreport Hopper as available and `rea doctor` report it healthy, while analysis\nthen failed with an unrelated `version_unresolved` rejection.\n\nRequire a regular file in both the provider availability probe and the\ndoctor executable probe, matching the Ghidra launcher check. A directory now\nreports `executable_missing`, and doctor reports `config_drift` with its\nexisting HOPPER_LAUNCHER_PATH remediation.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
