      "body": "fix(mcp): stop advertising complete Evidence in input examples (#1560)\n\nHosts forward every tool's input schema to the model on each request.\nSeventeen tools advertised a canonical example that embedded a complete\nproducer Evidence record, up to 22 KB each, accounting for 116 KB of the\n450 KB of advertised input schemas.\n\nAdvertised examples now show an embedded Evidence record as its exact\nretained-evidence reference when the canonical input accepts one, and\nomit an example that can only carry inline Evidence. Canonical contract\nexamples, their executable tests, and validation are unchanged.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
