      "subject": "feat(native): return a retained summary view of binary layouts on request (#1570)",
      "body": "feat(native): return a retained summary view of binary layouts on request (#1570)\n\ninspect_binary_layout accepts the same optional detail input as\nanalyze_javascript_application. The default complete delivery is\nunchanged; detail \"summary\" retains the complete layout Evidence in the\nsession and returns its inspect_analysis_view summary, whose\nparent_evidence_id selects sections, symbols, mitigations or linkage\nlater. Both tools share one detail schema and output projection.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
