      "sha": "0363e5a8e1be47f534c2fb7dfa26c579aa31ddd0",
      "subject": "fix(reference): join internal symlink targets with the inventory NFC normalizer (#1535)",
      "body": "fix(reference): join internal symlink targets with the inventory NFC normalizer (#1535)\n\n* fix(reference): join internal symlink targets with the inventory NFC normalizer\n\ncheckSymlinks resolved an internal symlink target with bare\nposix.normalize and looked the result up in the inventoried path set.\nA target that a filesystem reports in NFD (macOS readlink commonly\ndoes) joined to an NFD spelling while the inventory holds NFC, so\nvalidation reported \"Internal symlink target must resolve to an\ninventoried entry\" for a target the inventory actually contains.\n\nRoute the join through normalizeJoinedLogicalPath, the same inventory\nidentity normalizer #1513 applied to the runtime, HTML/module, and\nimport joins from #1488. The feature-seed NFKC query fold stays a\nquery.\n\nRefs #1488\n\n* fix(reference): preserve source spelling during symlink lookup\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: morluto <76467478+morluto@users.noreply.github.com>",
