      "sha": "38221cb12e86f5766d2e6c02ec7cae30f23bf2d7",
      "subject": "fix(native): bound PE resource RVAs by section virtual size (#1678)",
      "body": "fix(native): bound PE resource RVAs by section virtual size (#1678)\n\nThe PE resource reader treated each section as covering\n`max(VirtualSize, SizeOfRawData)` bytes, the mapping #1596 removed from\nmanaged RVA reads. A resource payload in the raw alignment padding past\nVirtualSize was reported with a hash of bytes the image loader never maps.\nA later section whose virtual range starts inside that padding was refused\nas an overlapping mapping.\n\nContainment and overlap now use the loader's virtual extent: VirtualSize,\nor SizeOfRawData when VirtualSize is zero. Ranges must still be file-backed.\n\nRefs #1596\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
