      "subject": "style(website): kbd, install-node width and nested collapsible indentation (#1699)",
      "body": "style(website): kbd, install-node width and nested collapsible indentation (#1699)\n\nStyle <kbd> keys, cap the Get started Node.js help section at the lede\nwidth, and indent open .evidence-details content with a subtle left\nborder so nested collapsibles step in at any depth.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
