    {
      "sha": "13e03e94363a007353fcb5dfedec764de12fc927",
      "subject": "perf(evidence): fuse streamed JSON token handling (#1694)",
      "body": "perf(evidence): fuse streamed JSON token handling (#1694)\n\nFuse upstream JSON parsing, scalar packing, heap admission, and value assembly into synchronous token stages while retaining asynchronous file reads and existing capacity, cancellation, decoding, identity, and typed-error semantics. Declare stream-chain 4.2.6 directly.\n\nValidation: 30 focused tests; check:fast, Knip and formatting; actual Flameox paired full-content oracles; real Linux evidence replay and Windows source-built package/Ghidra snapshot recovery; final-head CI 31/31 success.\n\nRefs #1065, #1680.",
