      "sha": "e8528cedcdfb1ca1d769304afdc353936e8e0d70",
      "subject": "fix(hopper): let failed one-shot commands exit while retaining a lease (#1763)",
      "body": "fix(hopper): let failed one-shot commands exit while retaining a lease (#1763)\n\n* fix(hopper): let failed one-shot commands exit while retaining a lease\n\nA Hopper target lease retained after unconfirmed cleanup kept its\nlistening socket referenced, so a one-shot CLI emitted its final\ncleanup_incomplete result but never exited, and its live lease rejected\nevery retry for the same target as already open.\n\nUnreference the lease listener. A live MCP process still holds the\nlease for as long as it runs; a completed CLI exits with status 1, and\nthe stale socket it leaves is recovered by the next acquirer.\n\nFixes #1751\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(hopper): remove only this test's stale lease sockets\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
