      "sha": "ee5275cd9fae8db64f945a0c8b59e1c19ac402c3",
      "subject": "fix(artifacts): count a changed partial-inventory root once (#1854)",
      "body": "fix(artifacts): count a changed partial-inventory root once (#1854)\n\nWhen partial inventories omitted node details, the root got an unknown\navailability row and the differing manifest root digests appended a\nsecond, changed content row, so one logical path was counted as both\nchanged and unknown. Fold the manifest content change into an existing\nunknown or changed root row instead, keeping its dimensions, occurrence\nand artifact identities, and citations; contradiction and presence rows\nare left as they are.\n\nFixes #1844\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
