      "sha": "7a0140b4aa43276368058ab98826b77e040ea14f",
      "subject": "fix(android): bound inline search Evidence with retained inventory provenance (#1890)",
      "body": "fix(android): bound inline search Evidence with retained inventory provenance (#1890)\n\nFocused and zero-match search_android_classes responses embedded every\nexamined class name: JadxSession records each raw list_classes page into\nobserved calls, those calls ride into Evidence raw_result on the\nregistration path, and the complete inline Evidence is serialized into\nevery tool response (issue #1850: 382,435 bytes for one match).\n\nWhen the server session retains Evidence, record the complete raw-call\nrecord first, then deliver a summary Evidence that keeps the pagination\naudit (totals, offsets, page sizes, elided item counts), the unchanged\nnormalized matches and truthful coverage metadata, and links the\nretained complete inventory by Evidence ID. Sessions without retention\nkeep the complete inline delivery, so complete CLI JSON output is\nunchanged and no provenance is discarded.\n\n🤖 Generated with AI assistance (disclosure voluntary per repo policy)",
