      "body": "fix(contracts): reject OS-invalid local paths in binary and artifact tools (#1925)\n\n* fix(contracts): reject OS-invalid local paths in binary and artifact tools\n\nEnforce localPathStringSchema across inspect_pe_resources,\ninspect_binary_layout, inspect_recorded_crash, inspect_wasm_artifact,\nand inspect_evm_interface input schemas to reject embedded NUL bytes at\nthe contract boundary instead of failing later during filesystem\noperations.\n\nAdd corresponding acceptance test cases to the advertised MCP contracts\nmatrix in localToolContracts.test.ts.\n\nSigned-off-by: Vinícius DS Andrade <95101505+viniciusdsandrade@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* style(contracts): wrap pe resources path description under print width\n\nWrap the inspectPeResourcesInputSchema path property description to keep lines within the 80-column oxfmt limit.\n\nSigned-off-by: Vinícius DS Andrade <95101505+viniciusdsandrade@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Vinícius DS Andrade <95101505+viniciusdsandrade@users.noreply.github.com>",
