      "subject": "fix(session): attribute selected-provider capabilities to the resolved identity (#2013)",
      "body": "fix(session): attribute selected-provider capabilities to the resolved identity (#2013)\n\nProfile resolution gives Ghidra and Hopper a concrete version, but the\nselected candidate's capabilities and the session route kept the\nprovider's static identity with a null version. binary_session therefore\ngrouped capability sets under a different identity than the binding and\nthe selected candidate.\n\nThe registry now rebinds the selected provider's capabilities to the\nresolved identity once, on the binding, and the route uses them. Evidence\nprovenance already compensated downstream by substituting the profile\nidentity; that repair is removed because the route now carries the\nresolved identity.\n\nFixes #2009\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
