      "subject": "fix(jeb): confine an invalid REA_JEB_MCP_URL to the JEB tools (#2145)",
      "body": "fix(jeb): confine an invalid REA_JEB_MCP_URL to the JEB tools (#2145)\n\nJebProvider throws when REA_JEB_MCP_URL fails endpoint validation, and the\ncomposition built it eagerly for the CLI and every MCP connection. A\nmalformed value, or http://localhost:8425/mcp, therefore crashed every CLI\ncommand with a stack trace and failed every MCP connection with an\ninternal server error. The composition now parses the endpoint first and,\nwhen it is unusable, returns a JEB port that reports not_configured\navailability and a ConfigurationError naming REA_JEB_MCP_URL.\n\nFixes #2143\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
