      "subject": "feat: add Frida instrumentation support (#1359)",
      "body": "feat: add Frida instrumentation support (#1359)\n\n* feat: add Frida instrumentation support\n\n* fix: resolve Frida CI checks\n\n* test: cover Frida contract validation branches\n\n* docs: link Frida instrumentation guide\n\n* fix(frida): handle cancellation cleanup safely\n\n* fix(frida): address PR review findings\n\n* fix(frida): preserve resume and message observations\n\n* fix(ci): use canonical registry for rolldown\n\n* fix(frida): declare foreign code effects\n\n* fix(frida): retain failed startup resources for cleanup retries\n\nKeep failed startup session and spawn handles owned until detach, resume,\nand remote lease cleanup complete. Serialize retries and release each\nremote reference once. Await CLI provider cleanup while preserving the\nprimary failure and any completed observations.\n\nAdd regressions for retained startup resources, concurrent cleanup,\nshared remote leases, and CLI cleanup outcomes.\n\nValidation: 41 focused tests pass on the PR head and its latest-main\nintegration; serial static and docs checks pass. Real Linux Frida 17.23.2\nworkflows and the native spawn/controlled-failure cleanup probe pass.\n\nAssisted-by: Kogasa (gensokyo-skills:kogasa-surprise-testing)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: N0zoM1z0 <1705004398@qq.com>",
