      "body": "fix(adb): count UTF-8 bytes in logcat total_bytes (#2212)\n\n* fix(adb): count UTF-8 bytes in logcat total_bytes\n\nread_adb_logcat assigned the decoded stdout string's UTF-16 code-unit\nlength to total_bytes, undercounting non-ASCII dumps (a 37-byte CJK line\nreported 33). Measure the UTF-8 byte length instead, matching the field's\nbyte-unit contract and the repo's Buffer.byteLength convention.\n\nFixes #2175\n\n* fix(adb): count raw captured bytes in logcat total_bytes\n\nCarry the pre-decode stdout byte length through runAdb so malformed\nUTF-8 (replaced by U+FFFD on decode) still reports the true captured\nbyte count instead of the re-encoded replacement size.",
