      "subject": "test(evm): verify real worker cancellation and cleanup recovery (#2404)",
      "body": "test(evm): verify real worker cancellation and cleanup recovery (#2404)\n\nVerify unchanged real EVMole worker replies through compiled CLI and stdio MCP, including late SDK cancellation, permission-induced retained cleanup failure/retry, preserved malformed-input diagnostics and a healthy real SQLite WASM peer. Add launcher receipts to prove blocked retries do not start another EVM worker.\n\nPreserve production contracts/defaults and explicit frozen-runtime/platform/measurement boundaries. Final head cf558a0661eb29bda932242abc3687b1860428e7 passes all 36 CI checks (run38313631216); manual final review and related real Factory rerun pass. Raw artifacts and receipts remain outside Git.\n\nCo-authored-by: factory-droid[bot] <138933559+factory-droid[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
