      "sha": "60f771a11e9889ce69cce6ad631b6b186ac742dd",
      "subject": "fix(apple): limit already-loaded reuse to rpath dependencies (#2292)",
      "body": "fix(apple): limit already-loaded reuse to rpath dependencies (#2292)\n\n* fix(apple): limit already-loaded reuse to rpath dependencies\n\ndyld reuses an already-loaded image by install name only for @rpath/\ndependencies (Loader.cpp:802-816) and evaluates other dependency forms\nagainst their expanded path for each loader. When multiple images in\ndifferent directories depend on @loader_path/ libraries sharing an\ninstall name, checking loaded images before candidate expansion caused\nsubsequent loaders to bind to the first loaded image's copy or appear\nresolved when their own copy was absent.\n\nLimit byInstallName registration and lookup to install names that start\nwith @rpath/, leaving caller-relative and literal dependencies to expand\nand evaluate their own candidate paths.\n\nSigned-off-by: Vinícius DS Andrade <95101505+viniciusdsandrade@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* test(apple): verify loader_path dependencies across isolated directories\n\nAssert that multiple images depending on @loader_path/ libraries with\nthe same install name do not reuse already-loaded images across loaders.\nWhen the second loader's helper is absent, its candidate path is absent\nand dyld reports required-load-unresolved; when both helpers exist, each\nloader resolves to its own directory.\n\nSigned-off-by: Vinícius DS Andrade <95101505+viniciusdsandrade@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Vinícius DS Andrade <95101505+viniciusdsandrade@users.noreply.github.com>",
