      "body": "fix(ida): stop the private input of a universal Mach-O at the end of the selected slice (#2291)\n\n* test(ida): expect the private input of a universal Mach-O to end at the selected slice\n\nCover a universal file larger than one read chunk with another slice after the selected one, for both a middle slice and the first slice.\n\n* fix(ida): stop the private input of a universal Mach-O at the end of the selected slice\n\nA read chunk that starts after the slice produced a negative end offset, and Buffer.subarray counts a negative bound from the end, so the head of the following slice was written to the private input and its digest.",
