      "subject": "ci: separate fast feedback from full qualification",
      "body": "ci: separate fast feedback from full qualification\n\nScope main pushes from a successful ancestor so canceled runs cannot hide changes. Keep the complete portable suite in fast feedback and move coverage plus Intel macOS to hourly, manual, explicit-full, and release qualification. Let qualification finish independently of superseded feedback.\n\nBind publication to full qualification at its exact revision and publish the verified tarball after checking workflow identity, version, and SHA-256. Keep trusted cache writers and reject incomplete merged test inventories.\n\nValidation: 151 focused CI tests; typecheck/lint; actionlint 1.7.7; knip; all 1044 files discovered; bounded blob/merge smoke; macOS package verifier with retention and cleanup; npm pack dry run. Native Linux/ARM/Windows and remote workflow execution remain CI verification.\n",
