    {
      "sha": "d13c9f840d36a321a56917e75c48afcb8d72920e",
      "subject": "ci: reduce redundant compatibility and qualification work",
      "body": "ci: reduce redundant compatibility and qualification work\n\nSelect SQLite compatibility by explicit source, fixture, lifecycle, and script ownership while retaining every version in full qualification. Share the canonical scope inventory between planning and the required gate.\n\nReuse recent exact-SHA full qualification only for hourly schedules, with trusted successful-run metadata and receipts. Force a daily refresh, reject stale original runs even after retries, and never renew proof from reused validation.\n\nReport attempt-specific queue, execution, and matched step timing in a separate completion workflow using trusted default-branch code and read-only API access. Preserve raw metadata and unknown timings without delaying validation or publication.\n\nValidation: 177 focused tests; typecheck/lint; knip; actionlint 1.7.7; all 1046 tests discovered; live 37-job API report smoke. Remote workflow scheduling and real-provider matrices remain CI verification.\n",
