      "body": "fix(call-path): keep caller-only unknown coverage from blocking not_found (#2371)\n\n* fix(call-path): keep caller-only unknown coverage from blocking not_found\n\nbuild_call_path expands only callee edges, so relationship coverage that\nis unknown solely because callers are unobservable (the modern headless\nIDA profile) no longer marks the searched callee closure incomplete.\nThe caller caveat stays visible in limitations, and callee-side unknowns\nstill yield unknown. Fixes #2322.\n\n* test(call-path): cover IDA-capped callees beside unknown callers\n\nGreptile review noted the poll-timing coverage only exercised unknown\ncallees, leaving the partial callees IDA returns at its 500-result cap\nuntested. Add the combined unknown-callers/partial-callees case:\nisCallerOnlyUnknownCoverage must stay false and buildCallPath must keep\nsearch_scope.exhaustive false, so a future change cannot silently report\nnot_found when IDA has omitted callees.",
