      "subject": "fix(javascript): keep CommonJS require file URLs unresolved (#2077)",
      "body": "fix(javascript): keep CommonJS require file URLs unresolved (#2077)\n\n* fix(javascript): keep CommonJS require file URLs unresolved\n\nrequire(\"file:///dep.cjs\") was reported as a resolved dependency of\nthe inventoried dep.cjs although Node rejects the string with\nMODULE_NOT_FOUND. The shared module-specifier resolver decoded file URLs\nbefore the declared CommonJS loader semantics.\n\nFile-URL decoding now applies only to non-require module specifiers, so a\nCommonJS file URL reports external with its declared string and source\nevidence preserved. ESM file URLs and ordinary relative require paths\nkeep their established lookup.\n\n* test(javascript): consolidate CommonJS file URL public workflow coverage\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: morluto <76467478+morluto@users.noreply.github.com>",
