      "subject": "perf(artifacts): share sealed inventory and report in inspect_artifact (#2690)",
      "body": "perf(artifacts): share sealed inventory and report in inspect_artifact (#2690)\n\ninspect_artifact parsed a fresh inventory and inspection report but left\nboth mutable, so each later Evidence boundary cloned and re-digested the\ncomplete payload: createArtifactInspection re-authenticated the nested\ninventory Evidence, createAnalysisExecution re-parsed the report, and\nrecordEvidence re-authenticated the outer Evidence.\n\nSeal both exclusively owned values with freezeJsonSnapshot so those\nboundaries take the existing immutable-snapshot path. Output is\nbyte-identical.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
