    {
      "sha": "5eb296649d2cd53b0bb74df7b3d8081e964e027d",
      "subject": "fix(native): refuse inspect_signature on non-Mach-O targets (#2262)",
      "body": "fix(native): refuse inspect_signature on non-Mach-O targets (#2262)\n\n* fix(native): refuse inspect_signature on non-Mach-O targets\n\nThis provider's signature inspection covers Mach-O code signatures only.\nOn a xar pkg, codesign's \"code object is not signed\" verdict cannot see\nthe archive-level signature layer, so a signed or invalidly-signed package\nwas reported as signed:false with \"Artifact is not signed.\" Match the\nexisting inspect_macho/list_architectures gate and report\ncapability_unavailable instead of an unsigned claim for a layer that was\nnever evaluated.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* test(native): scope the signature-gate comment to this provider\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(native): align signature capability discovery with Mach-O support\n\nBind inspect_signature availability to Mach-O targets in capability discovery and align the public tool description.\n\nSource inspection and git diff --check; tests/builds/typechecks/CI reruns skipped at explicit user request.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: morluto <76467478+morluto@users.noreply.github.com>",
