      "subject": "fix(process): preserve discovery ownership across cleanup retries (#2643)",
      "body": "fix(process): preserve discovery ownership across cleanup retries (#2643)\n\nBind retained descriptors and runtime resources to their admitting operation until cleanup succeeds, then rebind newly admitted work. Verify failed retries, successful recovery, shutdown and CLI projection.\n\nCo-authored-by: Kaoru0822 <208281322+kaoru0822-kitauji@users.noreply.github.com>",
