      "sha": "beca34f52258b7b25d72c160ae6fffa1cc3c034b",
      "subject": "fix(ida): report missing tools when a compatibility profile mismatches (#2307)",
      "body": "fix(ida): report missing tools when a compatibility profile mismatches (#2307)\n\nA profile mismatch reached the caller as a bare AnalysisProtocolError,\nwhich projects to `unreadable_output` with a generic message. The error\nalready named every missing tool, but none of that detail survived, so\nthe only way to identify the cause was to log the JSON-RPC traffic and\nnotice the exchange stopping after `tools/list`.\n\nThrow a ProviderAdapterError instead, carrying the mode, the expected\nprofile and the missing tool names through the diagnostics channel that\nalready surfaces in `details`. Document which upstream versions each\nprofile accepts, since upstream `main` now serves neither.\n\nRefs #2301\n\nCo-authored-by: morluto <76467478+morluto@users.noreply.github.com>",
