      "subject": "fix(apktool): resolve Windows PATH launchers before invocation (#2802)",
      "body": "fix(apktool): resolve Windows PATH launchers before invocation (#2802)\n\n* fix(apktool): resolve Windows PATH launchers before invocation\n\nResolve the default launcher through the selected PATH/PATHEXT before choosing native process creation or the existing conservative cmd.exe wrapper. Reuse the resulting selection and one canonical environment for the version probe and decode.\n\nFollow-up to the release #1693 review of #1777. Source inspected and formatted; tests, builds, check reruns and real Windows Apktool execution were skipped at maintainer request.\n\n* fix(apktool): bound lookup and retain only selected environment\n\nSource inspection and targeted formatting only. Tests, builds, lint, typechecks and provider workloads were not run at the user's explicit request.\n\n* fix(apktool): use supported timeout diagnostics\n\nRetain lookup phase through AnalysisErrorOptions diagnostics while preserving the operation and timeout identity. Source inspection and targeted formatting only; tests, checks, builds and provider workloads were skipped at the user request.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: morluto <morluto@users.noreply.github.com>",
