      "subject": "fix(mcp): count the error flag in error result budgets (#2848)",
      "body": "fix(mcp): count the error flag in error result budgets (#2848)\n\nError results reach the wire as text plus `isError: true`, but the\ntext-only envelope omitted the flag. An error up to 15 bytes above the\nresult budget passed both the delivery and transport checks and was sent\nas the original diagnostic instead of taking the oversized-error recovery\npath.\n\nRename the error representation to \"error-text\" and size its envelope\nwith the flag, so ToolResultDelivery and the error transport share the\ncomplete delivered shape. Successful structured results are unchanged.\n\nFixes #2557\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
