      "subject": "feat(setup): add Kimi Code client support (#2744)",
      "body": "feat(setup): add Kimi Code client support (#2744)\n\n* feat(setup): add Kimi Code client support\n\nRegisters rea in ~/.kimi-code/mcp.json (or $KIMI_CODE_HOME/mcp.json), preserving unrelated settings with a .rea.backup; registration is command-based stdio with no type field, startupTimeoutMs 30000 and toolTimeoutMs 120000 from MCP_STARTUP_POLICY.\nStrict JSON parsing: empty or whitespace-only files initialize; malformed JSON is rejected untouched with no backup; explicit transport other than stdio reports invalid.\nBundled skill uses the shared ~/.agents/skills destination that Kimi Code discovers, installed and verified through the shared-skill flow.\nValidated by 19 Kimi-specific tests, 260 adjacent-client regressions passing, check:fast and docs:check, and real-client verification on Kimi Code 0.40.1 (173 tools discovered, real mcp__rea__analyze_javascript_application call succeeded).\n\n* fix(setup): preserve Kimi tool filters and strict JSON coverage\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: morluto <76467478+morluto@users.noreply.github.com>",
