      "subject": "fix(targets): compare the Info.plist bplist prefix without ASCII folding (#2100)",
      "body": "fix(targets): compare the Info.plist bplist prefix without ASCII folding (#2100)\n\n* fix(targets): compare the Info.plist bplist prefix without ASCII folding\n\nThe six-byte prefix check used an encoding that maps high-bit bytes onto bplist, so a non-binary property list could be sent to the binary decoder.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(targets): satisfy the strict index check in the plist prefix test\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: morluto <76467478+morluto@users.noreply.github.com>",
