      "sha": "3f80b75708f88e51c64eb0122c178b96789c53b3",
      "subject": "fix(source-maps): keep sources when sourcesContent length differs (#2873)",
      "body": "fix(source-maps): keep sources when sourcesContent length differs (#2873)\n\nECMA-426 DecodeSourceMapSources reads a content slot only while its index\nis within sourcesContent, so a shorter array leaves trailing sources\nwithout content and a longer array adds no sources. Local application\nanalysis and browser collection rejected any length mismatch and dropped\nevery original from the map.\n\nThe content helper now checks only entry types. Browser collection drops\nits separate check because the leaf schema already validates every\nsupplied entry, and the raw records are still budgeted before parsing.\n\nFixes #2821",
