      "subject": "fix(ci): skip portable report merge when shards are skipped (#2943)",
      "body": "fix(ci): skip portable report merge when shards are skipped (#2943)\n\n* fix(ci): skip portable report merge when shards are skipped\n\nThe portable consumer can still run after an upstream build failure, even though the test-shard matrix is skipped and no Vitest blob artifacts exist. Guard artifact download and both report merge variants on successful shards; retain the required-shard gate so skipped or failed shards remain failures.\n\nThis applies the report-consumer condition from ee0256c740c9be18baae6c56d90285df8069f5b4 to current pinned main without changing action pins or required gates.\n\n* fix(ci): preserve failed shard diagnostics\n\n* docs: clarify current revision CI policy",
