      "sha": "0e6eca40857471341139e4203bfb32925b5333c5",
      "subject": "feat(native): read embedded cargo-auditable Rust dependency lists (#2456)",
      "body": "feat(native): read embedded cargo-auditable Rust dependency lists (#2456)\n\n* feat(native): read embedded cargo-auditable Rust dependency lists\n\n* fix(native): trim PE section padding and compute dependency cycles iteratively\n\n* fix(native): ignore SHT_NOBITS sections and validate dependency edges linearly\n\n* fix(native): bound compiler path scanning and retained hashes\n\n* fix(rust): pass package arrays as named parameterized test cases\n\n* fix(rust): admit graph expansion and preserve resource units\n\n* fix(rust): reject malformed packages, false cycles, and hidden compiler paths\n\nFail the first malformed cargo-auditable package before Zod collects an\nissue per field. Require cyclic dependency indices to match the cycles in\npackage dependencies. Keep read-only ELF ranges when a section name does\nnot fit the bounded name window, so a rustc path in that range is still\nreported.\n\n* fix(ci): repair integrated checks and Hopper test baseline\n\n* fix(go): verify Mach-O sections against segments\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Matt Van Horn <455140+mvanhorn@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: morluto <76467478+morluto@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>",
