      "subject": "fix(process): keep provider deadlines independent of wall-clock changes (#2311)",
      "body": "fix(process): keep provider deadlines independent of wall-clock changes (#2311)\n\n* fix(process): keep provider deadlines independent of wall-clock changes\n\n* fix(process): retain monotonic targets after early timers\n\nAdapt the stronger timer/poll owner from @nosmile99 PR #2793 as integrated by 21aa877e5 and captured main 94072364c7f8410b0e86e72c912c2611572b278f. Retain all contributor reliability coverage. Tests and workloads skipped by explicit request.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: morluto <76467478+morluto@users.noreply.github.com>",
