      "sha": "45a3509db34e2eca5558b90b06fca1baefdf3479",
      "subject": "fix(artifacts): compare inventories using declared coverage (#2214)",
      "body": "fix(artifacts): compare inventories using declared coverage (#2214)\n\n* fix(artifacts): preserve complete root inventory comparisons\n\n* fix(artifacts): declare inventory coverage before comparison\n\n* fix(artifacts): preserve traversal omissions and materialization limits\n\n* fix(artifacts): preserve coverage declarations and projection scope\n\nRemove the duplicate inventory-schema import. Compare original coverage declarations, including field omission, before adapting legacy pages. Require explicit scope for completeness and container-entry coverage for application projections.\n\nSource inspection and git diff --check only. Tests, builds and typechecks skipped by explicit user request. GitHub review writes paused globally.\n\n* fix(artifacts): require entry coverage for child changes\n\n* fix(artifacts): accept source-valid inventory limitations\n\n* style(artifacts): format mobile graph projection\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: morluto <76467478+morluto@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <openai-codex@users.noreply.github.com>",
