      "subject": "fix(package-verifier): reject overview responses without a procedure count (#2936)",
      "body": "fix(package-verifier): reject overview responses without a procedure count (#2936)\n\n* fix(package-verifier): reject overview responses without a procedure count\n\nThe analyze and inspect checks compared procedure_count with `< 1`, and an absent\nor null normalized_result makes that comparison false, so a binary_overview\nresponse without its required result passed the platform smoke check. Require an\ninteger procedure count before the positive-count comparison.\n\n* test(package-verifier): cover malformed overview receipts\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: REA Maintenance <76467478+morluto@users.noreply.github.com>",
