      "sha": "23dc8fbf83a36b7fb273674b74fc3c80de9acf1c",
      "subject": "fix(application): accept alternative document selection in binary_ove… (#2680)",
      "body": "fix(application): accept alternative document selection in binary_ove… (#2680)\n\n* fix(application): accept alternative document selection in binary_overview (#2460)\n\nUpdate binary_overview capability negotiation so that either current_document or list_documents satisfies the document identity requirement, matching resolveAnalysisDocument runtime semantics. When a provider declares neither document capability, resolveAnalysisDocument reports AnalysisCapabilityUnavailableError for current_document rather than leaking the internal list_documents fallback. Preserve list_segments as an independently mandatory requirement.\n\n* fix(application): retain document fallback provider errors\n\nReturn the fallback producer error unchanged, retaining operation identity, retry advice, diagnostics and cleanup instead of fabricating missing capabilities.\n\nSource inspection and git diff --check; tests/builds/typechecks/CI reruns skipped at explicit user request.\n\n* test(application): retain document fallback error expectations\n\nComposition and MCP controls now expect the original list_documents producer error and reason.\n\nSource inspection and git diff --check only. Tests, builds and typechecks skipped by explicit user request. GitHub review writes paused globally.\n\n* fix(ida): assert attached-mode routing failure\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: yashas1624 <yashas1624@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: morluto <76467478+morluto@users.noreply.github.com>",
