      "sha": "4d98123279c5a6f5442c458307f5a3ec678fd49e",
      "subject": "fix(hopper): recover from a Spotlight not-found launch (#2795)",
      "body": "fix(hopper): recover from a Spotlight not-found launch (#2795)\n\n* fix(hopper): recover from a Spotlight not-found launch\n\nHopper's native launcher locates the application through a fixed Spotlight\nquery before any Apple event. With indexing disabled it exits 3 with a\nnot-found report, but REA treated the external document as unconfirmed,\nretained the runtime and failed every later open_binary until the server\nrestarted. Recognize the complete report as a pre-handoff failure, confirm\nno document exists, and tell the caller to enable Spotlight indexing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(hopper): require empty stdout for native launch signatures\n\n* fix(hopper): retain ownership after unverified Spotlight reports\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: morluto <76467478+morluto@users.noreply.github.com>",
