    {
      "sha": "3a4d49406a4f3c0b566b6a16f3655c08b1354e19",
      "subject": "fix(javascript): preserve Electron runtime entrypoint paths (#2742)",
      "body": "fix(javascript): preserve Electron runtime entrypoint paths (#2742)\n\n* fix(javascript): preserve Electron runtime entrypoint paths\n\n* fix(javascript): resolve runtime entrypoints before modules\n\n* fix(javascript): preserve Electron runtime path semantics\n\n* fix(javascript): resolve Electron renderers exactly\n\n* fix(javascript): retain runtime package aliases\n\n* fix(javascript): retain missing renderer URL paths\n\n* fix(javascript): resolve Electron URL and utility entries correctly\n\n* fix(javascript): reject suffix-only worker URLs\n\n* fix(javascript): respect Electron URL and utility path semantics\n\n* fix(javascript): separate Node runtime entrypoints from source imports\n\n* fix(comparison): recheck historical calls-only changes (#2223)\n\n* fix(comparison): preserve incomplete function call evidence\n\nKeep missing, unknown, partial and unresolved call relationships unknown in function comparisons and reconstruction claims. Aggregate IDA caller and callee coverage without overwriting uncertainty.\n\nValidate with 144 focused tests, typecheck/lint, docs checks and test discovery. Real providers were not verified; the full headless IDA session suite requires unavailable Windows native controls.\n\n* fix(comparison): recheck historical calls-only changes\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: morluto <76467478+morluto@users.noreply.github.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 688defca0f4a3de04eb199f7754f323c68896c3c)\n\n* fix(ci): isolate Linux Hopper process fixture inventory\n\n(cherry picked from commit 8cac51e12184d56a9ba80a4427b3e6082ddac1ec)\n\n* fix(android): make DEX descriptor pattern portable\n\n(cherry picked from commit 1335bcddc569a1cfb34b6efedcb6f2e3aaaa3357)\n\n* fix: repair the static-check failures on the default branch (#2895)\n\n* fix: repair the static-check failures on the default branch\n\nThe default branch fails its own required `Static checks` job three ways, so\nevery pull request reports that job as failed regardless of its own change.\n\n- `npm run format:check` reports `src/domain/functionComparison.test.ts` and\n  `src/ida/IdaOperationRunner.ts`.\n- `npm run lint` reports a duplicate `import { join } from \"node:path\"` in\n  `tests/boundary/mcp/ghidraInventoryMcp.test.ts` (lines 4 and 17).\n- `npm run typecheck` reports `format: \"devin\"` missing from the client format\n  union in `src/application/SupportedClients.ts`, and an unchecked index in\n  `tests/boundary/cli/clientProfileLifecycle.test.ts`, whose pair array is\n  inferred as `string[][]`.\n\nApply the pinned formatter, drop the duplicate import, list the `\"devin\"` format\nthat its own definition already uses, and mark the pair array `as const`.\n\nValidation: `npm run check:fast` and `npm run format:check` pass.\n\n* fix(setup): keep Devin on the JSON configuration dialect\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: 吴佳浩 <wujiahao@supremind.com>\nCo-authored-by: morluto <76467478+morluto@users.noreply.github.com>\n(cherry picked from commit df3d96da801976fdbe37a726c2f4f84af8ffbf90)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: morluto <morluto@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: morluto <76467478+morluto@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Lucien <164857476+dakjdakd@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: 吴佳浩Alben <35291372+XiaoBinGan@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: 吴佳浩 <wujiahao@supremind.com>",
