    {
      "sha": "307af044bc0bdc15bc836c549e774220af8f459e",
      "subject": "perf(artifacts): overlap bundle magic reads while enumerating dylib roots (#3248)",
      "body": "perf(artifacts): overlap bundle magic reads while enumerating dylib roots (#3248)\n\n* perf(artifacts): overlap bundle magic reads while enumerating dylib roots\n\ntrace_dylib_resolution opened every file of an app bundle one at a time\nto read its Mach-O magic (Keynote: 35,971 files, 23 Mach-O images).\nKeep up to eight reads in flight while the directory walk continues,\nsettling them in walk order so classification and failure precedence\nmatch the sequential scan. Keynote 4.20 s -> 2.78 s.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(artifacts): pin ordered-read failure precedence and cleanup\n\nExtract the overlapped magic-read queue into consumeWithOrderedReads and\ntest its ordering, concurrency bound, failure precedence, enumeration\nclose and read settlement with controlled promises.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
