      "sha": "04345767a85394741416d1ebf8285db0eed7ca30",
      "subject": "perf(artifacts): run the asset catalog and Interface Builder bundle walks together (#3285)",
      "body": "perf(artifacts): run the asset catalog and Interface Builder bundle walks together (#3285)\n\n* perf(artifacts): run the asset catalog and Interface Builder bundle walks together\n\ninspect_asset_catalog walked the app bundle for Assets.car files and then\nwalked it again for the Interface Builder graph that supplies resource\nkeys. The analyses are independent, so start the Interface Builder one\nfirst and let a catalog failure cancel it and win, as the sequential\norder did. Keynote 4.20 s -> 2.89 s with identical output.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(artifacts): hold asset catalog and Interface Builder work open to pin overlap\n\nKeep the Interface Builder stub pending until catalog inspection starts,\nand keep catalog inspection pending while asserting an early Interface\nBuilder failure has not escaped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
